		\end{tablenotes}
	\end{threeparttable}
	\end{table}

  This channel is particularly relevant given the spatial inequalities between urban and rural communities in Jamaica, where rural households are considerably poorer and must travel further to access education. Tourism growth, while boosting incomes for urban households, may also exacerbate inequality by pricing out those who are most reliant on transportation services and most likely to be poor and geographically distant from schools.

